# Recording while it plays: a key held long sounds for as long as it's held, even when it lands on a step just
# recorded (the step isn't played over the held key, whose own note-off would cut it short), across the loop too
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 1090
key 12 down
wait 600
key 16 down
wait 200
key 12 up
wait 3000
key 16 up
wait 300
key 19 down
wait 400
expect meter_min 1 0.003
wait 1000
expect meter_min 1 0.003
wait 2000
expect meter_min 1 0.003
key 19 up
wait 500
